# Patch series. Every entry must match a patches/<id>.patch file whose SHA256
# matches, and every patches/*.patch must be declared here (checked on every
# pull request by build/checks/patch_integrity.sh and build/checks/
# manifest_schema.sh). Updates are reviewed pull requests only (rule 13.4).
patches:
  - id: "0100"
    name: SukiSU-Nova driver integration (drivers/kernelsu wiring)
    description: >-
      Wires the pinned SukiSU-Nova tree into the kernel build as a built-in
      driver (route A): registers drivers/kernelsu in drivers/Makefile and
      sources its Kconfig from drivers/Kconfig. Equivalent to the Makefile and
      Kconfig edits SukiSU-Nova's kernel/setup.sh performs at commit
      c60f21b9, re-recorded as a reviewed patch. The drivers/kernelsu symlink
      into the pinned submodule is created at build time by
      build/integrate_sukisu.sh (setup.sh's git clone/pull is never executed,
      project rule 13.4.2).
    source_url: https://github.com/SukiSU-Nova/SukiSU-Nova
    upstream_commit: c60f21b9e00e35e898f8d21e0612465b76b9beec
    sha256: ed098067e3d4266c9f4835972447a7ef2e6522be4218c6d96878104f951e3a87
    license: GPL-3.0-or-later